WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 44 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
This is Heavenbreaker, the weapon of Lord Magnus, the legendary dragon knight of House Valmont.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.600
He saved the realm with this lance. Every night here knows what it's worth.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.800
It stood in your courtyard for centuries. It should be covered in rust.

4
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.880
This one? It's glimming. You really expect us to believe this isn't a fake?

5
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.080
So this is Heavenbreaker, but can bring any dragon to heal?

6
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:26.080
No! It's not fake! It was rusted, then the rust just shattered off.

7
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.080
Lord Magnus' soul came back through the steel and saved our lives in the middle of the fight.

8
00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.840
Look at this thing! It's incredible!

9
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.280
Look at him! The kid's putting on a circus act!

10
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.560
Hey, I was just demonstrating. This lance is the real deal.

11
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:49.200
I pulled it straight out of the Heavenwing monument myself,

12
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.600
and there's a whole courtyard of witnesses to prove it.

13
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:56.080
If this thing is so legendary, how the hell did it end up in the hands of a clueless rucky like you?

14
00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:01.440
Uh, it was an emergency. Lord Magnus' soul was inside the lance,

15
00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:05.040
and it just grabbed the closest hand it could find. That hand happened to be mine.

16
00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:09.680
I was there that day. He just got lucky. The stone base had loosened over the centuries.

17
00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.240
Anyone with two hands could have yanked it out.

18
00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:17.600
Nonsense! Lord Magnus chose him! The greatest dragon knight in our history saw what's inside him.

19
00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:22.800
This isn't luck. This is destiny! Enough. I'll judge this lance myself.

20
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:25.040
Jackson, bring it to me.
